  "body": "Michael says this is synapse not a client ones\r\nhttps://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/15505\r\nhttps://github.com/vector-im/element-android/issues/2273\r\n\r\n> Nope, the count is calculated by the server; `notification_count` https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#get-matrix-client-r0-sync\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @t3chguy in https://github.com/vector-im/element-web/issues/15505#issuecomment-712769977_\r\n\r\nIt looks like missed calls are counted multiple times:\r\nWeb:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14617699/96571058-c0625000-12d3-11eb-8b31-b958912dbd5f.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14617699/96571598-70d05400-12d4-11eb-9106-f2ff96470187.png)\r\n\r\nAndroid:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14617699/96571083-cc4e1200-12d3-11eb-9b1c-78e9486b66eb.png)\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14617699/96571464-45e60000-12d4-11eb-8ea4-05114028897b.png)\r\n\r\nWith `Show hidden events` there 5 events:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14617699/96577332-1fc45e00-12dc-11eb-8a07-c7f2197fee74.png)\r\n\r\nSynapse 1.20.1 on debian stable",
